  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the given data with frequency distribution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>11</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Match each entry in List-I to the correct entries in List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>The mean of the above data is</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>The median of the above data is</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>The mean deviation about the<br />\t\t\tmean of the above data is</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>The mean deviation about the<br />\t\t\tmedian of the above data is</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The correct option is</p>",
